### Pytest Hook for Test Files
Runs relevant tests when test files are modified.

FastAPI has extensive pytest-based tests (100% coverage required). Running tests on save catches regressions immediately and ensures changes don't break existing functionality.

Add to `.claude/settings.json`:
```json
{
  "hooks": {
    "postToolExecution": [
      {
        "matcher": "Write|Edit",
        "globs": ["tests/**/*.py"],
        "command": "pytest \"$FILE_PATH\" -x --tb=short -q",
        "description": "Run tests with pytest",
        "continueOnError": true
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

**Setup**: Pytest is in the `tests` dependency group. Install with `uv sync --group tests`. The `-x` flag stops at first failure; `--tb=short` keeps output concise.

